SUMMARY:2026 Spring Convocation
DESCRIPTION:Congratulations to this year’s graduating class! \nU of T Engineering has three Convocation ceremonies on June 16: \n\n9:30 – 11 am: ChemE\, CivMin and EngSci\n1:30 – 3 pm: ECE and MSE\n5:30 – 7 pm: MIE\, UTIAS and BME\n\nFor more information about the upcoming ceremonies\, visit U of T’s convocation online hub
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/2026-spring-convocation/
LOCATION:Convocation Hall  @ 31 King’s College Circle
CATEGORIES:Convocation events
