SUMMARY:How to Get Your UTORid and TCard: New International Students
DESCRIPTION:Are you a new international student who needs to set up your UTORid and get your TCard? Do you have questions about your documents or the process? \nJoin this session offered by the TCard Services to understand: \n\nThe difference between your JOINid\, UTORid and TCard\nRequired documents to get your UTORid and TCards\nHow to upload your photo and documents\nWhen and where to pick up your TCard\nFrequently asked questions\nYou will have time to ask questions at the end of the session\n\nIf you have any questions\, visit the TCard Services website or contact them by email.
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/how-to-get-your-utorid-and-tcard-new-international-students-2/
LOCATION:Online
CATEGORIES:Info sessions
ORGANIZER;CN="TCard Services":MAILTO:https://tcard.utoronto.ca/
END:VEVENT
